<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Rufumbira New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">YUDA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc1">Urwandiko rwanditswe na YUDA</para>
  <para style="mt2">URWANDIKO RWANDITSWE NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">YUDA</para>
  <para style="imt">INYANZURO</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Urwandiko rwanditswe na Yuda</char> rwandikiwe kwamagirira abiigiisha b'ibinyoma biiyitaga abiizeera. Muri uru rwandiko rugufi ruhwanye n'urwandiko rwa Peetero rwa kabiri, umwanditsi ashiishikariza abasomyi be guharanira ukwizeera ko Imaana yahaaye abantu baayo rimwe n'iteeka ryose.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ibirimo</para>
  <para style="io1">Indamutso <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ingeso, inyigiisho n'iherezo ry'abiigiisha b'ibinyoma <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:3-16">1:3-16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kwihanangiriza abakristo gukomeza Kwizeera <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:17-23">1:17-23</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Guseezera <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:24-25">1:24-25</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="s">Indamutso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:55">Mat 13:55</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:3">Mar 6:3</ref>.</char>
    </note>Njeewe Yuda, umugaragu wa Yesu Kristo kandi mwene se wa Yaakobo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">ndabandikiye mwebwe abaahamagawe, bakundwa n'Imaana Daata kandi bakarindwa na Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Imbabazi, amahoro, n'urukundo bigwire muri mwe.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abiigiisha b'Ibinyoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Bakundwa, niteguurira kubandikira ibyerekeye agakiza dusangiye, naboonye ari ngombwa ko mbandikira mbashiishikariza guharanira ukwizeera mwahaawe n'Imaana rimwe n'iteeka ryose. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Kuko hari abantu bamwe batuubaha Imaana baabaseseyemo rwihishwa, bagahindura ukundi ubutumwa bw'ubuntu bw'Imaana yaacu kugira ngo babone uko bashira imbere ubukozi bw'ibibi bwabo, kandi ntibeemere umutegetsi n'Umwami waacu umwe ari we Yesu Kristo. Ariko keera byanditswe yuuko bazaaciirwa urubanza rw'iteeka.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Noone ubu nkaba niifuuza kubiibutsa n'ubwo mubiizi neeza yuuko Uhoraho yatabaaye abantu Biisirayeli rimwe ryonyine akabakuura mu gihugu ca Igiputi, ariko nyuma akarimbura abo boose batamwemeye. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Kandi n'abaamalayika bataagumye mu myanya Imaana yabahaaye, bakiikuura mu ciicaro caabo, Uhoraho yababoheesheje injegeri z'iteeka, abashira mu mwijima w'ikuzimu aho bategereje umunsi wo guciirwaho urubanza rw'iteeka. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Ni co kimwe n'abantu bo mu tawuni y'i Sodomu na Gomora n'amatawuni makuru batuuranye, abo bantu na bo biifashe nk'abo baamalayika biivanga mu bikorwa by'ubusambanyi no kugira irari ry'umubiri ridakwiranye na kameremuntu, bakaba baarahanwe bagatwikwa mu muriro w'iteeka kugira ngo babe ico kureeberaho.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Muri ubwo buryo, abo biigiisha b'ibinyoma bagira ibirooto bituma bangiiza imibiri yaabo, bagasuuzugura ubutegetsi bw'Imaana, ndetse bagatuka n'abaamalayika. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:7">Ibya 12:7</ref>.</char></note>Nyamara na malayika mukuru Mikayile ubwo yajaga impaka na Sataani batonganira umurambo wa Moose, ntiyahangaaye guciira Sataani urubanza amutuka, ahuubwo yaravuze ati, “Imaana izaaguhane” <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Ariko abo bantu bapfa gutuka ico badasobaanukiwe coose, bameze nk'inyamaaswa zitagira ubwenge, ibyo bintu badasobaanukirwa ni byo bibarimbura. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Bazaabona ishano! Kuko bakurikira inzira ya Kayini, kandi bakagwa mu buyobe bwa Balaamu wacumujwe no gukurikira inyungu. Na bo baagomeye Imaana nk'uko Koora yagomye, kandi ku bw'ibyo, bazaarimburwa. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Abo bantu baaza kuzambya gusangira kwanyu kwa kivandimwe. Bagasangira namwe nta soni kandi buuzuza inda zaabo gusa batiitaaye ku bandi. Bameze nk'ibicu bihuuhwa n'umuyaga ariko ntibigwishe imvura, kandi ni nk'ibiti biteera imbuto no mu gihe c'isaaruura, byaranduwe nuuko reero bikazaapfa kabiri. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Ibikorwa byabo biteeye isoni byiyerekana nk'uko inyanja yivumbagatanya igacura ifuro, bameze nk'inyenyeeri zizereera, zaagenewe umwijima w'icuraburindi iteeka ryose.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Kandi aba biigiisha b'ibinyoma ni bo Henoki wa karindwi mu maseekuruza kuva kuri Adamu, yahanuuyeho ati, “Dore Uhoraho azanye n'abeera be ibihumbi n'ibihumbi, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />guciira abantu boose urubanza no gushinja ibikorwa by'ubugomeramaana byose baakoze mu buryo budatungaaniye Imaana n'amagambo ashaariiriye abanyabyaha batuubaha Imaana baavuze bayituka.”<verse eid="JUD 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Abo bantu bahora biitotomba kandi baveeba abandi. Bagengwa n'irari ryabo, bagahora bavuga amagambo y'ubwibone kandi bakaryosharyosha abandi kugira ngo bababoneho inyungu.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwihanangiriza no Kwigiisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Mwebweho bakundwa, mukwiriye kwibuka ibyo Intumwa z'Umwami waacu Yesu Kristo zaavuze. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:3">2Pet 3:3</ref>.</char></note>Zaarababwiye ziti, “Mu bihe bya nyuma hazaabaho abasetsi, bakurikiza irari ry'ubugomeramaana bwabo.” <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Aba ni bo bantu bagengwa na kamere y'umubiri, ari nta Mwuka w'Imaana ubarimo bakabateeramo amacaakubiri. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Ariko mwe bakundwa, mukomeze gushikamira ku kwizeera kwanyu kwera kandi musenge muyobowe n'Umwuka Weera, <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />kandi mukomeze gukunda Imaana mutegereje Umwami waacu Yesu Kristo ngo abageze ku bugingo buhoraho ku bw'imbabazi ze.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Nuuko reero mugirire impuhwe abashidikanya, <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />murokore abandi mubasahuye mu muriro kandi abandi mubagirire impuhwe ariko zivanze n'ubwoba, ndetse mwange imyambaro yaabo yandujwe n'irari ry'ibyaha byabo.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Guseezera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Imaana, ari yo ibaasha kubarinda kugwa mu caaha, no kubahagarika imbere y'ubwiza bwayo mudafite inenge ahuubwo muneezeerewe bihebuuje, <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />Imaana imwe yoonyine ari yo Mukiza waacu tubikeesha Umwami waacu Yesu Kristo, ihaabwe ikuzo, ubushobozi, ubutware, n'ububaasha, uheereye keera koose, kugeza ubu n'iteeka ryose! Amiina.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>